            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EThis week Sebastiaan and Lotte look at two packages from Blend Interactive for adding and configuring your site\u2019s (or sites\u2019) sitemap.xml and robots.txt. During the demo Sebastiaan sets up Claude Code to use the Umbraco MCP Server, and uses that to save some time, or perhaps mouse clicks!\n\n\u0026#128230; Blend \u200BInteractive \u200BUmbraco Sitemap on the Umbraco Marketplace: https://marketplace.umbraco.com/package/blendinteractive.umbraco.sitemap\n\u0026#128230; Blend \u200BInteractive \u200BUmbraco \u200BRobots\u200BTxt on the Umbraco Marketplace: https://marketplace.umbraco.com/package/blendinteractive.umbraco.robotstxt \n\n--------\n\u2753 Looking for help with your Umbraco projects? Visit the Forum\n https://forum.umbraco.com\n \n\u0026#128172; Want to chat with the friendly Umbraco Community? Join our Discord server\n https://discord.umbraco.com\n \n\u2709\uFE0F Got a question (or topic suggestion) for the HQ Developer Relations team?\n https://umbra.co/contact-devrel, or the \u2018contact-devrel\u2019 channel on Discord\n \n#Umbraco\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HV5_7VGdLxg\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022 rel=\u0022noopener\u0022\u003ERead the original article\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
